<title>USA: Lockheed Martin opens down on NYSE.</title>
<headline>Lockheed Martin opens down on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Lockheed Martin Corp opened down two to 102 on the New York Stock Exchange following the company's proposed $11.6 billion merger deal with Northrop Grumman Corp.</p>
</text>
